OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with rain spreading from the
OL,7,Fwest. Drier and clearer weather will
OL,8,Fdevelop during the early hours but
OL,9,Fstill a few showers in the west. Fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds developing
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,14,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,15,Fand most frequent across the west.
OL,16,FFresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
