OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAfter a
OL,6,Fmainly dry start on Friday outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain will spread east in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Windy with bright spells
OL,9,Fand a few showers on Saturday. Dry on
OL,10,FSunday.
